    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15170" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ēdŭcātĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		2. edŭco, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a breeding</i>, <i>rearing</i>,
				<i>training</i>, <i>bringing up</i>,
				<i>education</i> (good prose). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> Of men, <i><span class="en">Cic. de
				Or. 3, 31, 124</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Leg. 3, 13</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Quint. 1,
				1, 21</span></i>; <i><span class="en">1, 2,
			6</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Tac. A. 3, 52</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. G.
			20</span></i> et saep.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b> Of animals, <i><span class="en">Cic. Fin. 3,
				19</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Rosc. Am. 22 <i>fin.</i></span></i>; <i><span class="en">Col. 7, 12, 11</span></i>; <i><span class="en">8, 11,
			1</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b> Of
			plants, <i><span class="en">Plin. 16, 25, 39, § 94</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">Macr. S. 1, 7</span></i>.</div>
